#!ipxe
# Chainload the official netboot.xyz iPXE menu.
#
# Note: boot.netboot.xyz/ipxe/netboot.xyz.ipxe no longer exists (404). The
# current entry point is boot.netboot.xyz/menu.ipxe, which loads the menu
# via relative paths and works over plain HTTP.
#
# HTTPS requires an iPXE build with HTTPS support. If the build lacks it,
# the HTTPS attempt fails with "Operation not supported" (ipxe.org/3c092003),
# so HTTP is tried first.
#
# Place this file in the TFTP root (e.g. /mnt/data/tftpboot/netboot.xyz.ipxe).
chain --autofree http://boot.netboot.xyz/menu.ipxe ||
chain --autofree https://boot.netboot.xyz/menu.ipxe ||
shell
